<section class="wrap section community-page"><p class="eyebrow">THE SHARED WORKBENCH / AN OPEN INVITATION</p><h1>The useful part of the internet <br>is <em>each other.</em></h1><p class="lead community-intro">Remember finding the exact answer on somebody’s little technical website? That’s the idea here. Practical notes, questions worth investigating, and things we can make clearer together.</p>
  <div class="community-grid">
    <article><span class="community-symbol">?</span><h2>Ask for a how-to.</h2><p>Something awkward in your homelab? A PHP problem that deserves a clear example? Suggest a question for the notebook.</p><a class="button" href="<?= escape(contribution_url('question')) ?>">Suggest a topic <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></article>
    <article><span class="community-symbol">+</span><h2>Pass on a useful trick.</h2><p>A command you keep forgetting, a troubleshooting habit, or a small tool that made your day easier. Explain what it solves.</p><a class="button" href="<?= escape(contribution_url('tip')) ?>">Share a tip <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></article>
